OL,3,GNEWSABonnie Tyler's family thank
OL,4,Asupporters for compassion after funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FBonnie Tyler's family has paid tribute
OL,7,Fto supporters after her funeral service
OL,8,Fattracted thousands of fans and well
OL,9,Fwishers.
OL,11,FThey publicly thanked organisations and
OL,12,Findividuals who helped "from the day
OL,13,FBonnie arrived home to our last 'bye
OL,14,Fdarling'", including Welsh choir Only
OL,15,FMen Aloud who performed at Monday's
OL,16,Fservice in Swansea.
OL,18,FThe singer, whose real name was Gaynor
OL,19,FHopkins, died on 8 July, aged 75, at a
OL,20,Fhospital in Portugal.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
